[{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01090000_04_0000","text":"果穗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01090000_04_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01090000_04_0010","text":"（拍了好多好多啊……！）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01090000_04_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01090000_04_0020","text":"（照片，除了气味以外什么都能留下来……！\n　好厉害……！）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01090000_04_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01090000_04_0030","text":"（开心的回忆也好，大家的优点也好，\n　不知不觉间都拍下来了）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01090000_04_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01090000_04_0040","text":"（全部，都能一直一直保存下去……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01090000_04_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01090000_04_0050","text":"（感觉通过这次集训，更了解大家了！）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01090000_04_0060","text":"（小千代前辈、树里酱、凛世小姐、夏叶小姐\n　──还有……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01090000_04_0070","text":"给，果穗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01090000_04_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01090000_04_0080","text":"哦，果穗\n怎么了，差不多该准备回去了吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01090000_04_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01090000_04_0090","text":"制作人！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01090000_04_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01090000_04_0100","text":"能当摄影担当，\n我真的真的超级超级开心！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01090000_04_0110","text":"谢谢您给我这个任务……！"}]
